    "title": "George Fox STUNT Team Wins Back-to-Back Division III National Championships - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Branden Andersen ,\n2 days ago NASHVILLE, Tenn. — The George Fox University STUNT team claimed its second consecutive Division III national championship Sunday, defeating top-ranked Muskingum University 25-20 in the title game at Lipscomb University in Nashville, Tennessee. The Bruins entered the final day of competition from the losers’ bracket after a 26-21 loss... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
